join michael_jackson left [animation="Fade In"]
michael_jackson: hee hee~
set {michael.HAS_TALKED_TO} = true
- fight me
	if {michael.PLAYER_ON_STAGE} == true:
		eyyy let's go bro
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"action":"fight","subject":"michael"}"]
	else:
		michael_jackson: get up here then
- How do I get up there? | [if {michael.REDIRECT_TO_BARTENDER} == false]
	michael_jackson: Backstage is locked. Ask the bartender about a key.
	michael_jackson: Once you have the key. [wave][ns=0] [lspeed=0.05]♫ Give it to me ♫ [pause=0.5] [lspeed=0.01] HEE~ [pause=0.5] [lspeed=0.05] ♫ pass it to me ♫ [pause=0.5] [lspeed=0.01] HEE~ [input]
	set {michael.REDIRECT_TO_BARTENDER} = true
- give backstage key | [if {michael.REDIRECT_TO_BARTENDER} == true && {michael.HAS_STAGE_KEY} == false]
	if Inventory.has_item("backstage_key"):
		michael_jackson: You have the key !
		do Inventory.remove("backstage_key")
		set {michael.HAS_STAGE_KEY} = true
	else:
		michael_jackson: you no have key !
- exit